<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>HotNews — 中國，每一天。</title><description>Daily stories about China in technology, finance, sports, entertainment, lifestyle, science, travel and culture — for readers around the world.</description><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/</link><language>zh-TW</language><item><title>中國汽車業進入重整期 交易與聯盟格局生變</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260926-autos-chinas-auto-industry-hits-reset-as/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260926-autos-chinas-auto-industry-hits-reset-as/</guid><description>從華為承諾不造車，到保時捷的再生電池電芯，再到北京新車展，中國汽車產業正進入整合、出口成長與技術重新定位的決定性階段。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>exports</category><category>technology</category><category>huawei</category><category>byd</category><category>dongfeng</category><category>porsche</category></item><item><title>中國汽車業轉向技能發展 全球野心日益增長</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260926-autos-chinas-auto-industry-pivots-to-skills/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260926-autos-chinas-auto-industry-pivots-to-skills/</guid><description>隨著中國汽車製造商向全球擴張，上海的一場全國技能競賽凸顯了對能夠製造和維修下一代車輛的技術人員日益增長的需求。此次活動展示了培訓和產業合作如何塑造移動出行的未來。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>autos</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>shanghai</category><category>worldskills</category><category>vocational-training</category><category>china-auto-industry</category><category>exports</category></item><item><title>華為重申「不造車」 中國汽車聯盟格局生變</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260926-autos-huawei-repeats-we-dont-build-cars/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260926-autos-huawei-repeats-we-dont-build-cars/</guid><description>華為創辦人任正非向東風高管表示，公司將繼續協助車廠打造更智慧的汽車，而非自行造車；同時華為汽車業務負責人表示，與賽力斯合作的問界品牌正應賽力斯要求進行調整。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>technology</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>economy</category><category>huawei</category><category>dongfeng</category><category>aito</category><category>seres</category></item><item><title>中國新家庭劇問：愛由誰買單</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260926-culture-chinas-new-family-dramas-ask-who/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260926-culture-chinas-new-family-dramas-ask-who/</guid><description>近期兩部中國電影，包括九月上映的《燃燒吧！爸爸》，正促使觀眾質疑「家庭之愛必須以犧牲來證明」的觀念。影評人與觀眾表示，這場辯論反映出中國家庭談論責任與自我的方式正悄然轉變。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>culture</category><category>film</category><category>entertainment</category><category>box-office</category><category>family</category><category>burning-dad</category><category>jing-yidan</category><category>shanghai</category></item><item><title>中國微短劇熱潮：一個家庭花費22.5萬元看短劇</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260926-entertainment-chinas-micro-drama-boom-one-family-spent/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260926-entertainment-chinas-micro-drama-boom-one-family-spent/</guid><description>中國媒體一則瘋傳的報導講述一名年近七旬的女性兩年內在微短劇上花費22.58萬元——這些豎屏、每集一分鐘的肥皂劇正在重塑中國娛樂。此事引發全國對追劇、自動續費以及年長觀眾如何上癮的討論。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>entertainment</category><category>film</category><category>digital</category><category>lifestyle</category><category>daily-life</category><category>micro-drama</category><category>douyin</category><category>mobile-payment</category></item><item><title>中國音樂界擁抱懷舊 劉歡逝世享年63歲</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260926-entertainment-chinas-music-world-embraces-nostalgia-as/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260926-entertainment-chinas-music-world-embraces-nostalgia-as/</guid><description>深受喜愛的歌手劉歡逝世，享年63歲，這在中國音樂界掀起了一股懷舊浪潮，老歌如今在串流播放清單中佔據主導地位。新一代聽眾正在重新發現1980年代和1990年代的經典金曲。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>entertainment</category><category>music</category><category>nostalgia</category><category>liu-huan</category><category>streaming</category><category>culture</category><category>china-music</category></item><item><title>中國銀幕熱鬧非凡 多樣新片齊發</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260926-entertainment-chinas-silver-screen-heats-up-with/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260926-entertainment-chinas-silver-screen-heats-up-with/</guid><description>中國影院本週提供豐富多樣的國產劇情片、喜劇和國際史詩鉅片，從美食公路之旅到昆汀·塔倫提諾的雙片連映。觀眾還可在大銀幕重溫《刺激1995》等經典。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>film</category><category>entertainment</category><category>box-office</category><category>culture</category><category>welcome-to-the-dragon-restaurant</category><category>empty-gun</category><category>kill-bill</category><category>the-odyssey</category></item><item><title>蘋果與高通續簽專利協議，單日市值增加750億美元</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260926-finance-apple-and-qualcomm-renew-patent-deal/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260926-finance-apple-and-qualcomm-renew-patent-deal/</guid><description>蘋果與高通簽署新的全球專利授權協議，自2027年4月起生效，結束多年來對權利金支付的不確定性。蘋果股價創下歷史新高，單一交易日市值增加約750億美元。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>finance</category><category>stocks</category><category>technology</category><category>apple</category><category>qualcomm</category><category>patents</category><category>smartphones</category><category>ipo</category></item><item><title>瑞幸咖啡獲阿布達比基金Mubadala注資10億美元</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260926-finance-luckin-coffee-lands-1-billion-from/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260926-finance-luckin-coffee-lands-1-billion-from/</guid><description>阿布達比主權基金Mubadala與瑞幸咖啡控股股東聯手，向這家連鎖咖啡品牌投資約10億美元，對這家曾因財務造假醜聞而幾乎崩潰的企業投下引人注目的信任票。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>finance</category><category>coffee</category><category>luckin-coffee</category><category>stocks</category><category>economy</category><category>mubadala</category><category>centurium-capital</category><category>china-consumer</category></item><item><title>中國A股盈利回升 帶動科技、資源與金融類股</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260926-finance-chinas-a-share-earnings-rebound-lifts-tech/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260926-finance-chinas-a-share-earnings-rebound-lifts-tech/</guid><description>半年報顯示，中國上市公司2026年第二季利潤加速增長，半導體、金屬與券商領漲，消費類股則落後。復甦正擴散至更多行業，但整體情況仍不均衡。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>finance</category><category>stocks</category><category>economy</category><category>technology</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>a-shares</category><category>semiconductors</category><category>china-earnings</category></item><item><title>中國獨立與 AAA 工作室重押全球玩家市場</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260926-games-chinas-indie-and-aaa-studios-bet/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260926-games-chinas-indie-and-aaa-studios-bet/</guid><description>從俯視角撤離射擊遊戲到亞瑟王動作史詩，中國開發者正將雄心勃勃的新作推向 Steam 與家用主機，直指全球玩家。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>games</category><category>technology</category><category>entertainment</category><category>steam</category><category>tencent</category><category>mihoyo</category><category>sword-net-3</category><category>gamescom</category></item><item><title>中國遊戲工作室大舉押注全球PC與主機市場</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260926-games-chinese-game-studios-bet-big-on/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260926-games-chinese-game-studios-bet-big-on/</guid><description>多家中國開發商正準備推出重要PC作品，包括即將邁向1.0版的動作角色扮演遊戲《流亡黯道2》，以及預定十月在Steam展開搶先體驗的合作射擊遊戲《No Such Place》。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>games</category><category>technology</category><category>digital</category><category>entertainment</category><category>steam</category><category>path-of-exile</category><category>mihoyo</category><category>esports</category></item><item><title>《魔法門之英雄無敵 III》回歸：27 年經典策略遊戲推出 3D 重製版</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260926-games-heroes-of-might-and-magic-iii/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260926-games-heroes-of-might-and-magic-iii/</guid><description>Ubisoft 宣布將全面以 3D、4K 重製《魔法門之英雄無敵 III》，這款 1999 年的回合制策略遊戲至今仍擁有全球忠實粉絲。遊戲將於 2027 年在 PC、PS5 和 Xbox Series X|S 上推出，並包含兩個原版資料片。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>games</category><category>entertainment</category><category>technology</category><category>digital</category><category>ubisoft</category><category>heroes-of-might-and-magic</category><category>gamescom</category><category>pc-gaming</category></item><item><title>IKEA 的 Matter 智慧家庭裝置終於進軍中國</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260926-lifestyle-ikeas-matter-smart-home-gear-finally/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260926-lifestyle-ikeas-matter-smart-home-gear-finally/</guid><description>在海外上市後，IKEA 價格實惠、相容 Matter 的智慧家庭產品正悄悄通過中國認證，預示著即將在中國大陸首次亮相。此舉可能撼動長期由小米、華為等本土生態系統主導的市場。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>smart-home</category><category>lifestyle</category><category>technology</category><category>design</category><category>ikea</category><category>matter</category><category>xiaomi</category><category>daily-life</category></item><item><title>米其林指南首度登陸深圳，首次評鑑即頒發七顆星</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260926-lifestyle-michelin-guide-debuts-in-shenzhen-awarding/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260926-lifestyle-michelin-guide-debuts-in-shenzhen-awarding/</guid><description>2026年廣州與深圳米其林指南標誌著深圳首次成為米其林目的地，七家星級餐廳首度亮相。合併名單共收錄176家餐飲場所，反映餐飲界正從快速擴張轉向營運成熟。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>lifestyle</category><category>food</category><category>michelin-guide</category><category>shenzhen</category><category>guangzhou</category><category>dining</category><category>greater-bay-area</category><category>restaurants</category></item><item><title>為何中國成年人願意花大錢買樂高</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260926-lifestyle-why-grown-ups-in-china-are-spending/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260926-lifestyle-why-grown-ups-in-china-are-spending/</guid><description>成人樂高拼砌在中國已成為一種真正的生活方式，在職專業人士紛紛購買積木版的汽車、花卉和世界盃獎盃。品牌和名人如今正積極爭取這群愛玩又肯花錢的成年受眾。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>lifestyle</category><category>design</category><category>daily-life</category><category>games</category><category>culture</category><category>lego</category><category>wang-yibo</category><category>collecting</category></item><item><title>為什麼搓一根頭髮會讓它捲成小彈簧</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/science/20260926-science-why-rubbing-a-strand-of-hair/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/science/20260926-science-why-rubbing-a-strand-of-hair/</guid><description>一個簡單的餐桌實驗揭示了關於人類頭髮的奇特事實：用指甲夾住一根頭髮拉過去，髮尾會捲成完美的螺旋。科學家表示，答案在於頭髮的構造，而非魔法。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>science</category><category>research</category><category>daily-life</category><category>healthcare</category><category>lifestyle</category><category>materials-science</category><category>hair-science</category></item><item><title>亞運：杭州熱度升溫 中國田徑明星閃耀</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260926-sports-asian-games-chinas-track-stars-shine/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260926-sports-asian-games-chinas-track-stars-shine/</guid><description>在杭州舉行的亞運會上，中國短跑和跨欄選手在雨中主導賽場，而羽毛球和乒乓球選手則深入晉級。這場在中國東部城市舉行的運動會已成為東道主新興體育人才的展示舞台。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>sports</category><category>asian-games</category><category>hangzhou</category><category>track-and-field</category><category>badminton</category><category>table-tennis</category><category>football</category><category>athletics</category></item><item><title>亞運第三天：中國羽球與桌球隊持續挺進</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260926-sports-asian-games-day-3-chinas-badminton/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260926-sports-asian-games-day-3-chinas-badminton/</guid><description>在杭州亞運會上，中國選手王祉怡在羽球女單比賽中因韓國對手退賽而晉級，而中國組合在羽球雙打和桌球八強賽中佔據主導地位。男子足球隊自1998年以來首次闖入四強。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>asian-games</category><category>sports</category><category>table-tennis</category><category>badminton</category><category>hangzhou</category><category>china-national-team</category><category>wang-zhiyi</category><category>wu-yanni</category></item><item><title>中國跨欄選手衝進亞運決賽</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260926-sports-chinas-sprinters-storm-into-asian-games/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260926-sports-chinas-sprinters-storm-into-asian-games/</guid><description>在杭州一個大雨滂沱的夜晚，兩名中國跨欄選手晉級男子110公尺決賽，而中國羽球和桌球代表隊則在亞運淘汰賽中繼續挺進。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>sports</category><category>asian-games</category><category>hangzhou</category><category>running</category><category>table-tennis</category><category>athletics</category><category>badminton</category><category>china-sports</category></item><item><title>中國AI電影工作室吸引急欲招攬的城市紛紛來電</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260926-tech-ai-film-studios-in-china-draw/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260926-tech-ai-film-studios-in-china-draw/</guid><description>隨著製作成本崩跌，中國各城市與產業園區正積極招攬AI電影製作人，部分AI短劇如今每分鐘成本僅需數百元人民幣。深圳創作者朱志力表示，邀約源源不絕。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>film</category><category>animation</category><category>innovation</category><category>digital</category><category>shenzhen</category><category>ai-video</category><category>entertainment</category></item><item><title>中國 FAST 望遠鏡改寫恆星形成減緩之謎</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260926-tech-chinas-fast-telescope-rewrites-the-story/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260926-tech-chinas-fast-telescope-rewrites-the-story/</guid><description>透過結合 FAST 電波望遠鏡與美國暗能量巡天，一個國際團隊發現星系並非耗盡了形成恆星的氣體，而是失去了將其轉化為恆星的能力。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>astronomy</category><category>research</category><category>technology</category><category>science</category><category>fast-telescope</category><category>desi</category><category>galaxy-evolution</category><category>china-astronomy</category></item><item><title>OpenCode 將 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 額度永久化</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260926-tech-opencode-makes-deepseek-v41-flash-credit/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260926-tech-opencode-makes-deepseek-v41-flash-credit/</guid><description>OpenCode 已將其 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 的 60 美元額度永久化，此舉降低了全球開發者使用 AI 編碼的成本。這項原本為臨時性的促銷活動，如今為這款中國模型鎖定了關鍵的價格優勢。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>ai</category><category>deepseek</category><category>opencode</category><category>software-development</category><category>innovation</category><category>digital</category></item><item><title>悅榕集團收購非洲酒店集團，拓展至七個新國家</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/travel/20260926-travel-banyan-tree-buys-african-hotel-group/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/travel/20260926-travel-banyan-tree-buys-african-hotel-group/</guid><description>總部位於新加坡的悅榕集團已同意收購Newmark Hotels &amp; Reserves的多數股權，為其全球版圖增添七個非洲國家。這項於9月17日宣布的交易，標誌著這個豪華酒店品牌在國際擴張上邁出重要一步。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>travel-guide</category><category>aviation</category><category>lifestyle</category><category>luxury-travel</category><category>banyan-tree</category><category>hotels</category><category>africa</category><category>singapore</category></item><item><title>希爾頓現已進駐中國300個目的地</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/travel/20260926-travel-hilton-now-reaches-300-destinations-across/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/travel/20260926-travel-hilton-now-reaches-300-destinations-across/</guid><description>希爾頓表示其中國業務組合已超過1,100家酒店，遍及300個目的地，從主要城市到較小的縣級城鎮。這一擴張反映出全球酒店集團正競相服務中國國內旅客。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>travel-guide</category><category>lifestyle</category><category>cities</category><category>hotels</category><category>hilton</category><category>china-travel</category><category>hospitality</category><category>domestic-tourism</category></item><item><title>香港瑰麗酒店蟬聯全球最佳酒店</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/travel/20260926-travel-hong-kongs-rosewood-hotel-named-worlds/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/travel/20260926-travel-hong-kongs-rosewood-hotel-named-worlds/</guid><description>2026年全球最受矚目的酒店排名（現更名為The 50）將香港瑰麗酒店保持在第一名。這份榜單與中國新酒店開幕潮顯示，該國奢華旅遊版圖正快速重繪。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>travel-guide</category><category>lifestyle</category><category>design</category><category>shanghai</category><category>hong-kong</category><category>rosewood</category><category>macau</category><category>hilton</category></item><item><title>中國汽車業面臨新車型與交易浪潮</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-chinas-auto-industry-faces-a-wave/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-chinas-auto-industry-faces-a-wave/</guid><description>中國汽車市場本週忙碌，共有九款新車型上市、兩家國有車廠進行重大重組，以及華為與賽力斯合作關係的轉變，顯示競爭與整合正在加劇。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>economy</category><category>exports</category><category>byd</category><category>huawei</category><category>gac</category><category>seres</category></item><item><title>中國汽車維修人才缺口擴大 電動車熱潮加速</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-chinas-auto-repair-talent-gap-grows/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-chinas-auto-repair-talent-gap-grows/</guid><description>中國電動車熱潮正造成熟練維修技師短缺，薪資翻倍但職位仍空缺。上海世界技能大賽凸顯現代車輛所需的先進技能。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>technology</category><category>education</category><category>shanghai</category><category>worldskills</category><category>ev-repair</category><category>skills-gap</category></item><item><title>中國電動車維修廠找不到足夠的技師</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-chinas-electric-car-repair-shops-cant/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-chinas-electric-car-repair-shops-cant/</guid><description>隨著電動車湧入中國道路，維修廠正苦於招聘既懂機械又懂軟體的技師。在上海的世界技能大賽上，年輕技師展示了為何這份工作如今需要程式設計技能。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>technology</category><category>china</category><category>shanghai</category><category>worldskills</category><category>auto-repair</category><category>workforce</category></item><item><title>中國電動車維修人才荒：薪水翻倍仍無人問津</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-chinas-ev-repair-shortage-double-the/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-chinas-ev-repair-shortage-double-the/</guid><description>隨著電動車湧上中國道路，合格的維修技師嚴重短缺的問題正浮現。如今修理電動車需要機械、電氣和軟體技能——而培訓管道卻難以跟上。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>technology</category><category>lifestyle</category><category>shanghai</category><category>worldskills</category><category>china-auto</category><category>vocational-training</category></item><item><title>一天九款新車：中國擁擠的電動車市場內幕</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-one-day-nine-new-cars-inside/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260925-autos-one-day-nine-new-cars-inside/</guid><description>9月23日，吉利、長安和騰勢等品牌的九款新車型在同一天進入中國展廳。這種堆疊反映了全球最大汽車市場的殘酷競爭，太多車型追逐太少買家。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>autos</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>economy</category><category>geely</category><category>byd</category><category>huawei</category><category>gac</category></item><item><title>2026年布克獎入圍名單揭曉，頌揚AI無法複製的寫作</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260925-culture-booker-prize-2026-shortlist-unveiled-celebrating/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260925-culture-booker-prize-2026-shortlist-unveiled-celebrating/</guid><description>2026年布克獎入圍名單在倫敦公佈，包含來自四個國家的六部小說，其中包括兩位前得主和三位首次入圍者。評審團主席瑪麗·比爾德稱這份名單為「文學寫作的巔峰」，強調這些作品抗拒AI的複製。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>culture</category><category>books</category><category>literature</category><category>booker-prize</category><category>mary-beard</category><category>publishing</category><category>ai</category><category>london</category></item><item><title>中國AI漫劇熱潮迎來首次大洗牌</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-ai-comic-drama-boom-meets/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-ai-comic-drama-boom-meets/</guid><description>中國AI生成的漫劇在八個月內暴增至超過38萬部，但平台支付下降引發42%的工作室退出。這場危機呼應了日本1980年代的動畫衰退，創作者正在尋找可持續的模式。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>entertainment</category><category>animation</category><category>film</category><category>technology</category><category>ai-comic-drama</category><category>china-streaming</category><category>digital</category><category>culture</category></item><item><title>中國票房熱潮：本土英雄與全球經典</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-box-office-buzz-local-heroes/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-box-office-buzz-local-heroes/</guid><description>中國影院本週推出多樣化片單，從歷史史詩《敦煌英雄》到昆汀·塔倫蒂諾的《追殺比爾》重映，同時新喜劇和驚悚片持續娛樂觀眾。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>film</category><category>box-office</category><category>entertainment</category><category>cinema</category><category>douban</category><category>dunhuang-heroes</category><category>the-odyssey</category><category>kill-bill</category></item><item><title>本週中國票房：作者導演、大片與一場盛大的演員重聚</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-box-office-this-week-auteurs/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-box-office-this-week-auteurs/</guid><description>中國影院本週排片滿檔——從唐代史詩到諾蘭的《奧德賽》——同時香港老將梁家輝與于謙在新犯罪喜劇中同台飆戲。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>entertainment</category><category>film</category><category>box-office</category><category>culture</category><category>dunhuang-heroes</category><category>christopher-nolan</category><category>tony-leung-ka-fai</category><category>douban</category></item><item><title>中國螢幕滿是故事——以及一場盛大的告別</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-screens-are-full-of-stories/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-screens-are-full-of-stories/</guid><description>備受喜愛的中國演員游本昌以93歲高齡辭世，同時戲院裡充斥著來自中國大陸與好萊塢的新片，短篇AI動畫則湧入線上平台。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>entertainment</category><category>film</category><category>box-office</category><category>animation</category><category>culture</category><category>you-benchang</category><category>douban</category><category>chinese-cinema</category></item><item><title>中國情境喜劇的乾旱：笑聲軌為何沉寂</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-sitcom-drought-why-the-laugh/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-sitcom-drought-why-the-laugh/</guid><description>一篇爆紅文章追問為何中國鮮少再產出熱門情境喜劇，追溯此類型從1993年的《我愛我家》到《愛情公寓》——以及串流、審查和短影音改變了什麼。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>entertainment</category><category>film</category><category>culture</category><category>daily-life</category><category>digital</category><category>i-love-my-family</category><category>ipartment</category><category>streaming</category></item><item><title>中國A股兩年內增加7兆美元——那麼究竟是誰贏了？</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-chinas-a-shares-add-7-trillion-in/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-chinas-a-shares-add-7-trillion-in/</guid><description>自2024年9月以來，上海基準指數已上漲45%，市值增加約51兆元人民幣。然而許多普通投資者表示，他們在這波漲勢中幾乎沒有收穫，這個落差揭示了中國股市收益分配有多麼不均。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>finance</category><category>stocks</category><category>economy</category><category>shanghai</category><category>star-market</category><category>innovation</category><category>tencent</category><category>hong-kong-stocks</category></item><item><title>中國ETF市場創下新里程碑，債券基金規模突破1兆美元</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-chinas-etf-market-hits-new-milestone/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-chinas-etf-market-hits-new-milestone/</guid><description>中國債券交易所交易基金（ETF）首次突破1兆美元大關，同時針對創新藥物和軟體服務的新股票指數也相繼推出。這一里程碑反映出投資者對中國大陸市場多元化、低成本投資工具的需求日益增長。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>finance</category><category>stocks</category><category>economy</category><category>etf</category><category>shanghai</category><category>china-bonds</category><category>star-market</category><category>innovative-drugs</category></item><item><title>中國純化設備製造商乘生物科技浪潮瞄準IPO</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-chinese-purification-equipment-maker-aims-for/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-chinese-purification-equipment-maker-aims-for/</guid><description>總部位於天津的歐尚源已更新其深圳創業板上市招股說明書，乘著中國合成生物學熱潮，客戶包括製藥巨頭浙江新和成和食品集團中糧。其應收帳款快速增長，引發關注。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>finance</category><category>ipo</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>research</category><category>stocks</category><category>biotech</category><category>synthetic-biology</category><category>shenzhen</category></item></channel></rss>